[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0996","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0996.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1167","title":"Third Voice Web Annotation 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Third Voice Web Annotation 注释工具存在跨站脚本（XSS）安全漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在注释内容中注入恶意 JavaScript 脚本，当其他用户浏览包含恶意注释的页面时触发该漏洞，从而导致攻击者能够窃取用户的敏感会话数据、窃取身份认证凭据或生成伪造的网页内容实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响了 Third Voice Web Annotation 用户的数据机密性和完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1167"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:51Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Third Voice Web Annotation 浏览器插件，该软件已停止维护且无官方安全更新。作为通用缓解措施，在 Web 应用中启用 Content-Security-Policy HTTP 响应头（如 script-src 'self'），并对所有用户输入实施严格的输出编码（HTML实体编码），防止恶意脚本注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7252.php","http://www.wired.com/news/technology/0%2C1282%2C20636%2C00.html","http://www.wired.com/news/technology/0%2C1282%2C20677%2C00.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1167.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1167","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1167.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1167.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qgpq-pjxc-x5wq/GHSA-qgpq-pjxc-x5wq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83040/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1167.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/be7ad03fdf3a412f0fd57a25f1732dc0ecfb1cb3/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0996.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0988","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0988.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1157","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 TCP/IP ICMP Subnet Mask 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 TCP/IP 协议栈组件 tcpip.sys 在处理 ICMP 子网掩码地址请求（Subnet Mask Address Request）数据包时存在缺陷。当目标系统在同一网络接口上绑定了多个 IP 地址时，远程攻击者可向该主机发送特制的 ICMP 子网掩码请求报文，触发协议栈处理异常，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 SP4 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，但需目标系统配置多 IP 地址作为前置条件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1157"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:50Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 或更高版本，该补丁修复了 tcpip.sys 对异常 ICMP Subnet Mask Address Request 报文的处理逻辑。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙或路由器上过滤入站的 ICMP Subnet Mask 地址请求报文（类型 17、代码 0）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q192/7/74.ASP","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3894","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1157.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1157.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1157","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1157.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1157.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2pvc-9pxf-rw8p/GHSA-2pvc-9pxf-rw8p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86277/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1157.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0988.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0980","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0980.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1148","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 FTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 及更早版本的 FTP 服务存在资源耗尽型拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过与目标 FTP 服务器同时建立大量被动（PASV）连接，耗尽服务器连接资源，导致正常服务不可用。该漏洞利用复杂度低、无需特殊权限，影响安装了 IIS 4.0 FTP 服务的 Windows NT 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1148"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:49Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft Security Bulletin MS98-006 (KB189262) 提供的更新补丁，该补丁限制了对 IIS 线程池的过度消耗。如无法安装补丁，建议将 FTP 服务与 WWW 服务分离到不同服务器，避免 FTP 连接耗尽导致 Web 服务中断；同时配置防火墙限制 FTP 端口的并发连接数，并监控系统事件日志中大量 \"Passive connect timed out\" 告警以识别攻击源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q189/2/62.ASP","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-006","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1215","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1148.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1148","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1148.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1148.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xr94-m5ww-76cc/GHSA-xr94-m5ww-76cc.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1148.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1148.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001002.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/839e2559933f5ff6cd50b4768fd382827d790668/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0980.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0978","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0978.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1132","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Routing Information Field 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 在处理 Token Ring 网络的源路由转发信息时存在缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送路由信息字段（RIF）中跳数超过 7 的特制数据包，或者包含重复 Token Ring ID 的列表，触发异常处理错误导致系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 操作系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1132"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:47Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 针对此漏洞发布的安全更新（KB Q179157），该补丁限制了 Token Ring 源路由数据包中 RIF 跳数及重复 ID 的处理。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本。临时缓解措施可在网络边界防火墙或路由器上丢弃源路由选项（Loose Source Routing 和 Strict Source Routing）的 IP 数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90763508011966&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=90760603030452&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q179/1/57.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/1399.php","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1132.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1132.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1132","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24512263eb77d6af2cecd67bd2460f761fc94bea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1132.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1132.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3cw4-pq4g-xq2f/GHSA-3cw4-pq4g-xq2f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1132.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--39d3e7ff-2b55-479e-90b9-e099e1c741c0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0978.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0959","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0959.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1124","title":"Allaire ColdFusion HTTP Client 访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"ColdFusion 的 HTTP Client 应用存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 mainframeset.cfm 应用提交目标页面参数，利用服务器端请求转发机制访问受限制的 Web 页面。由于该请求从服务器本地发起，访问控制机制无法有效拦截，导致攻击者能够绕过端口级别的访问限制，获取本应受保护的非授权资源。该漏洞影响 Adobe ColdFusion 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1124"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:46Z","remediation":"升级 ColdFusion Server 至官方修复版本（4.5.1 及以上），或移除/重命名 `mainframeset.cfm` 文件阻断代理请求路径。临时缓解措施为在 Web 服务器层（如 IIS）配置 URL 访问规则，禁止外部请求访问 `mainframeset.cfm`，并在防火墙规则中限制 ColdFusion 服务对外部内网端口的出站连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstorm.securify.com/mag/phrack/phrack54/P54-08","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/248c2167e720df96125f6ac9925793063a207510/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1124","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3508ccc52a2baed6a1946843005e8957c7067f39/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-11xx/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc6f74915c306ca5f0e8feb3a1630bc318e69157/1999/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3254b0243059843609b70bbf6d468af5b834d86d/api/1999/CVE-1999-1124.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1124.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0959.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0957","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0957.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1117","title":"IBM AIX lquerypv 本地文件读取漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.1 及 4.2 版本中 lquerypv 工具存在任意文件读取漏洞，本地攻击者可通过 -h 命令行参数指定任意文件路径，导致系统敏感信息泄露。该漏洞源于程序未对用户传入的文件路径参数进行充分过滤，攻击者拥有本地账号即可利用，影响范围有限但可读取 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1117"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:45Z","remediation":"升级至 AIX 5.1 及以上版本以彻底修复该漏洞；若无法升级，安装 AIX 4.2.1 对应 APAR 补丁 (IX68465)。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod 750 /usr/sbin/lquerypv` 限制 lquerypv 仅 root 和 system 组可执行，或移除该文件的 setuid 权限 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/lquerypv`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-13.shtml","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420195&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420196&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&w=2&r=1&s=lquerypv&q=b","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/455","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1752","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19345","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1117.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1117","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1117.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/248c2167e720df96125f6ac9925793063a207510/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1117.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g9xm-g3q5-pm76/GHSA-g9xm-g3q5-pm76.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1117.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2965ee5f-33dd-4bc7-9bea-43e0e83e5800.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0b7b3d855cd8fca7b800fb29d6754e2da82897b6/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0957.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0947","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0947.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1105","title":"Microsoft Windows 95 Remote Administration 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Windows 95 在启用 NetWare 网络的远程管理和文件共享功能后，当管理员远程登录系统时会自动创建隐藏的 C$ 共享，远程攻击者可通过映射网络驱动器的方式访问该共享，从而读取目标系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Windows 95 操作系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，但需要管理员已远程登录过目标系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1105"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:43Z","remediation":"Windows 95 已停止支持且无官方补丁，建议立即升级至受支持版本的 Windows（如 Windows 10/11）。如无法升级，请禁用\"NetWare 网络远程管理与文件共享\"功能：控制面板 → 网络 → 服务中移除该组件；同时在防火墙中禁止 TCP 139/445 端口入站连接，并限制管理员远程登录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7231.php","http://www.net-security.sk/bugs/NT/netware1.html","http://www.zdnet.com/eweek/reviews/1016/tr42bug.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1105.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e25ede9c3545efaa8ff0b393e30e48edb07502a8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1105.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1105.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/55853b6e755a0ecd08195e09435b787f0cba6bbe/1999/CVE-1999-1105.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rcfw-38c9-2wm8/GHSA-rcfw-38c9-2wm8.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1105","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1105.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1105.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000996.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0947.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0942","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0942.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1102","title":"BSD lpr 符号链接攻击本地任意文件写入漏洞","description":"BSD 系列操作系统（包括 SunOS 4.1.1、BSD 4.3、A/UX 2.0.1 等）中的 lpr 行式打印服务存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接（symlink）攻击，在反复调用 lpr 命令约 1000 次后，利用程序对临时文件处理不当的竞态条件，将任意内容写入或覆盖系统任意文件，从而可能导致权限提升或破坏系统完整性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，利用需本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1102"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:43Z","remediation":"升级 lpr 到已修复符号链接竞争条件的版本，或替换为 LPRng/CUPS 打印系统。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户执行 lpr 的权限，将 lp 设备文件权限设为 0700，并监控 /tmp 目录的符号链接创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/e-25.shtml","http://www.aenigma.net/resources/maillist/bugtraq/1994/0091.htm","http://www.phreak.org/archives/security/8lgm/8lgm.lpr","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94380d498cb52b65d051c9bd443b6f2aa85bf8ec/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1102.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1102","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1102.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cdbbe57bd34c799f670485304ef54912650bf03b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1102.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-97ch-49wx-wfmx/GHSA-97ch-49wx-wfmx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88452/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1102.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--be2ec783-c4fb-40a3-9c11-0cb511dfa34f.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--be2ec783-c4fb-40a3-9c11-0cb511dfa34f.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0942.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0940","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0940.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1100","title":"Cisco PIX Private Link 配置文件 DES 密钥强度漏洞","description":"Cisco PIX Private Link 4.1.6 及更早版本在处理配置文件中的特定命令时存在安全缺陷，导致 DES 加密密钥的有效长度从标准的 56 位被降低至 48 位。攻击者可通过暴力枚举攻击显著降低破解密钥所需的计算复杂度，进而解密受保护的通信链路。该漏洞影响使用 Cisco PIX Private Link 功能的所有早期版本设备，攻击者只需获取配置文件访问权限即可利用此弱点实施攻击，无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1100"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:43Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco PIX 防火墙软件至 4.1.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 DES 密钥长度截断问题。如无法升级，应在配置中禁用 Private Link 的 DES 加密，改用 3DES 或 AES 等更强加密算法替代，并限制对配置文件的物理访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/i-056.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/pixkey-pub.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1579"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0940.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0936","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0936.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1093","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer JScript 脚本引擎缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.01 SP1 及更早版本中的 JScript 脚本引擎的 Window.External 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响早期 Windows 系统上的 IE 浏览器，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害较大。建议用户升级至更高版本的 IE 浏览器以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1093"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:42Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 5.0 或更高版本即可消除此漏洞。如无法升级浏览器，可在 Internet 选项→安全→自定义级别中将「活动脚本」禁用作为临时缓解方案；建议停止使用 IE 内核浏览器，改用 Edge 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器以避免遗留漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q191/2/00.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/1276.php","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-011","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1093","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1093.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1093.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2w6r-5vhj-25r3/GHSA-2w6r-5vhj-25r3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1093.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--01b36f88-506e-4fbb-9503-8cad88f7bb41.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88090/info.html","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0936.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0931","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0931.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1084","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 AEDebug 注册表项权限设置不当本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 系统中 AEDebug 注册表项权限设置不当，本地攻击者可修改该注册表项指向恶意调试器程序。当系统发生崩溃时，系统会自动执行该注册表项指定的调试器，从而以系统权限运行木马程序，导致机密性、完整性和可用性受损。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，无需额外认证即可利用此漏洞。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-008 中发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1084"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:41Z","remediation":"限制对注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\AEDebug 的写入权限，仅保留 SYSTEM 和 Administrators 的完全控制权，移除 Users 组的写入权限。建议升级至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022），NT 4.0 已停止安全更新多年。可通过组策略或 regedit 的权限设置对该注册表项应用更严格的 ACL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=90222453431604&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q103/8/61.asp","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/k-029.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1044","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-008","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19798"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0931.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0921","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0921.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1074","title":"Webmin 暴力破解权限提升漏洞","description":"Webmin 0.5 之前版本存在登录认证缺陷，未对针对有效用户名的密码尝试次数进行限制。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞对已知用户名实施暴力破解攻击，通过大量尝试弱口令或字典密码获取系统管理员权限。该漏洞影响 Webmin 早期版本，攻击无需任何前置条件，且可远程触发，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1074"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:40Z","remediation":"升级 Webmin 至 0.5 或更高版本，该版本已限制同一用户名下的无效密码尝试次数。作为临时缓解措施，可配置 fail2ban 规则对 Webmin 登录接口进行频率限制，或通过防火墙限制可访问 Webmin 管理端口的来源 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9138","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98","http://www.webmin.com/webmin/changes.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0921.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0921.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0921.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0890","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0890.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1042","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9130,\"outputTokens\":26,\"totalTokens\":10820}}","description":"Cisco Resource Manager (CRM) 1.0 与 1.1 版本在运行过程中会创建具有全局可读权限（world-readable）的日志文件及临时文件，导致本地用户可读取到其中存储的敏感信息。由于文件权限配置不当，任何具有本地系统访问权限的用户均可直接读取这些文件，从而泄露用户标识（User ID）、明文密码以及 SNMP 团体字符串（community string）等凭据。该漏洞影响范围限于已安装上述版本 CRM 且存在本地账户的 Cisco 设备，攻击者无需特殊权限，仅需以普通本地用户身份访问文件系统即可利用，属于典型的信息泄露类本地漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1042"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:35Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Cisco Resource Manager 1.2 或更高版本（已修复文件权限问题），或将现有 CRM 1.0/1.1 的日志与临时文件目录权限修改为 600（仅所有者可读写）。若无法升级，请限制本地账号访问权限，并迁移至 CiscoWorks 等受支持的网络管理平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/crmtmp-pub.shtml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49836c1c79a31c6cbe258de560530ef5be1db5f4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1042.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1042","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1042.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/36499b7630ab4a32d11ab7c901b4c87271211bec/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1042.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ae10aeb9b17952d60531f6bc06df8547d2b0b568/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qqff-qxc6-9qw5/GHSA-qqff-qxc6-9qw5.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87012/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1042.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/70290debf97c1057397e6f7c8c733dec0658bf76/1999.tsv","https://github.com/kookaip/PhD-ICSE2023-PrivacyVulnerabilities/blob/f07e7ceba63e856fe3d9dd40cee793b0ef452153/replication-package/data/7-cve-coder2.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0890.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0889","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0889.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1035","title":"Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 HTTP GET 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 和 4.0 在 x86 和 Alpha 平台上存在 HTTP GET 拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送畸形的 HTTP GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致 IIS 服务挂起停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行在 x86 和 Alpha 处理器架构上的 IIS 3.0 和 4.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发送畸形 GET 请求触发漏洞，导致 Web 服务停止响应。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危级别拒绝服务漏洞，微软已发布补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1035"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:34Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft Security Bulletin MS99-019 的安全补丁（KB234905），修复 IIS 3.0/4.0 对畸形 HTTP GET 请求处理不当导致的拒绝服务漏洞。若无法立即打补丁，可在 IIS 管理器中删除 .HTR、.IDC、.STM 等不需要的脚本映射，或在防火墙层面过滤包含畸形请求行的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q192/2/96.asp","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-019","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1035.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7dbcfe83bb4dc502ef05181d3fc65159afa615a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1035","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fb79aaf8eeeb3ec551114292cd7a8693e166aee6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1035.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1035.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6da213119b3c54637329347c0dc42c66b8a84f0a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rpfw-6596-9q7g/GHSA-rpfw-6596-9q7g.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1035.yaml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1035.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0889.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0579","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0815","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 SNMP Agent 内存泄露拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 SP5 之前版本的 SNMP 代理存在内存泄漏漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可向目标系统发送大量 SNMP 查询请求，导致 SNMP 代理进程内存持续耗尽，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 SP5 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，仅需向目标发送大量 SNMP 查询请求即可耗尽系统内存资源导致服务拒绝，CVSS 评分 5.0，属中危拒绝服务漏洞。Microsoft 已在 Windows NT 4.0 SP5 中修复此漏洞，建议升级至 SP5 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0815"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:06Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 5 或更高版本以修复 SNMP Agent 内存泄漏漏洞。若无法立即升级，可通过服务管理器禁用 SNMP 服务（snmp.exe）或在防火墙层面阻断 UDP 161 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q196/2/70.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1974","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A952","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0815.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/df06113bb625f86b49f1950d55874a29f8e76a55/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0815.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0815","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5297adfba5e91ee22e711c26c523b292d427c0d0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0815.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0815.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hj67-mggc-gx7v/GHSA-hj67-mggc-gx7v.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0815.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0579.toml"}]